    {
      "id": "q24_solution",
      "condition": "직각삼각형 $\\text{ABC}$에서 $\\sin A = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{BC}}}{\\overline{\\text{AB}}} = \\frac{3}{5}$이고 $\\overline{\\text{AB}}=10$이므로 $$\\overline{\\text{BC}} = 10 \\times \\frac{3}{5} = 6$$ 피타고라스 정리에 의해 $$\\overline{\\text{AC}} = \\sqrt{10^2 - 6^2} = \\sqrt{64} = 8$$ 따라서 $$\\cos A = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{AC}}}{\\overline{\\text{AB}}} = \\frac{8}{10} = \\frac{4}{5}, \\quad \\tan A = \\frac{\\overline{\\text{BC}}}{\\overline{\\text{AC}}} = \\frac{6}{8} = \\frac{3}{4}$$",
      "mappedTo": "mathPlan.nodes"
    }
  ],
